$************************RELEASE VERSION*********************************** 


$ MatCalc thermodynamic database for titanium alloys, 
$ Ti-aluminides and TiAl-based complex concentrated alloys.
$
$ Vesion 2.00 created 2019-02-28
$ Release of Version 2.03 January 2025 by MatCalc Engineering GmbH.
$
$ This database contains edited and 
$ newly assessed thermodynamic data for Ti-alloys.
$ Thermodynamic parameters have been assessed at TU Wien 
$ by Povoden-Karadeniz Erwin. 
$
$ 2019-02-28_re-edit ordered B2 Al-Ti according to Wit and re-assess Ti-Al-V (E. Povoden-Karadeniz)
$ 2019-09-24_re-assess Ti-Al-V, Ti-Al-Mo-Nb, Ti-Al-Nb-V (E. Povoden-Karadeniz)
$ 2019-09-26_re-assess Ti-Al-V - alpha-beta transus, ordered B2 (E. Povoden-Karadeniz)
$ January 2025 - reassess Ti-Aluminides TNM and transus T in Ti6Al4V (E. Povoden-Karadeniz)
$ January 2025 - include Omega phase (E. Povoden-Karadeniz)
$
$ ##########################################################################
